  "contracts": {
    "world": "World-hunk-owned raw RGB, faces and tree views; samples unaffected by atlas packing, overbright or stage collapse. Planar faces use the first vertex normal, double plane distance and twice-normalized texture axes. Patches and non-lightmapped materials do not sample.",
    "traversal": "Original mutable-segment front-to-back walk; 2048-unit downward ray, 128-pixel RGB pitch, floored binary32 texture coordinates, equal-distance replacement and nearest split pruning. Iterative stack bounded to validated BSP43 depth.",
    "dynamic": "Radius-inclusive contribution with double length, squared-radius power and minimum distance 16; any nonzero native flags add 32; common maximum-channel normalization; identical ambient/directed RGB.",
    "diffuse": "Fixed original direction projected on entity axes without normalization. Double dot/lighting expression, original low-word signed-integer truncation, negative byte wrap and upper clamp.",
    "animation_control": "IHV-only r_lerpmodels default 1, flags 0. Float signed zero and NaN disable; other nonzero values enable; same frame forces zero. Exact raw-bit control read by address, raster/ray dispatch and native-model ray-cache signature.",
    "precision": "Scoped precise math and explicit binary32/double spills; byte-level integer-conversion guards accept original indefinite outcomes without unsafe casts. Fast-math compiler behavior verified with sanitizer fixtures.",
    "isolation": "Legacy entities and every other profile retain their existing paths. RTX optional ray transport/material lighting is unchanged; raster evidence does not establish ray-lighting visual parity."
